{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "id": "behind-the-scenes-s01e08-scene-16",
  "pair": "zh-en",
  "title": "开会前十五分钟  (Fifteen Minutes Before the Pitch)",
  "level": "A1 — beginner",
  "labels": {
    "xingzi": "杏子",
    "bu_xiaogu": "布小谷",
    "kaiwen": "凯文"
  },
  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "With only fifteen minutes left before the moved-up pitch review, Xingzi, Bu Xiaogu, and Kaiwen hear rumours of Studio Four's drama and prepare to play it safe—until Chun Yuqiao walks in. Listen to the Mandarin first.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "不是你告诉老大方案会提前吗？那他为什么提前出院呢？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我能做什么呀？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "昨天演播室的事我都听说了，听说闻老师跟淳于总闹不愉快了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "什么？不可能！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "出了院不来上班，这不像他呀。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "方案会还有十五分钟就要开始了，用不着这么催吧。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "改版方案的演示稿我已经赶出来了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "昨天晚上我把保守方案也邮件发给老大了，但是没有回馈。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "这改版方案提前跟谁都没沟通过，肯定被毙。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "保守方案上会，一切等老大回来再说。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "小谷，一会儿跟我打个配合。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "老大！你怎么回来了？",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "不是你告诉老大方案会提前吗？那他为什么提前出院呢？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Did you not tell the boss the pitch was moved up? Then why did he leave hospital early?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我能做什么呀？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'What could I possibly have done?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "昨天演播室的事我都听说了，听说闻老师跟淳于总闹不愉快了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I heard all about yesterday's studio incident—rumour says Wen Simo and Chun Yuqiao clashed.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "什么？不可能！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'What? Impossible!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "出了院不来上班，这不像他呀。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Checking out of hospital without coming straight to work does not sound like him.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "方案会还有十五分钟就要开始了，用不着这么催吧。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'The pitch meeting starts in fifteen minutes—no need to rush us so hard.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "改版方案的演示稿我已经赶出来了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I have already finished rushing out the slide deck for the overhaul plan.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "昨天晚上我把保守方案也邮件发给老大了，但是没有回馈。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Last night I emailed the conservative plan to the boss too, yet got no reply.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "这改版方案提前跟谁都没沟通过，肯定被毙。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'This overhaul plan has not been cleared with anyone beforehand; it would surely be rejected.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "保守方案上会，一切等老大回来再说。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'We take the conservative plan into the meeting and save everything else until the boss returns.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaiwen",
      "t": "小谷，一会儿跟我打个配合。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Xiaogu, back me up smoothly in the room in a moment.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "老大！你怎么回来了？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Boss! How come you are back?'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's listen to the whole conversation one last time.",
      "gap": 0.75
    },
    {
      "v": "xingzi",
      "t": "不是你告诉老大方案会提前吗？那他为什么提前出院呢？",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我能做什么呀？",
      "gap": 0.5
